{# main_helia_ml.cc — heliaPROFILER firmware for the heliaML engine #}
/**
 * @file main.cc
 * @brief heliaPROFILER firmware (heliaML) — auto-generated, do not edit.
 *
 * heliaML is traditional ML: the whole model is ONE public call with no
 * operator graph, no interpreter, and no arena to bind.  This template
 * is therefore deliberately small next to main_aot.cc.j2 — it times the
 * generated module's run entry point end-to-end and emits exactly one
 * PMU row per iteration ("model_run:0").  Anything per-op would be an
 * invention, not a measurement.
 */

